/* CMSEPL9 TESTEXEC - See CMSEPLA ASSEMBLE:TEST9. */
Parse version Version
Say "TEST9 running on" Version
Parse source System Environment FN FT FM Command Prefix
If System <> "CMS" then Return 1
If Environment <> "COMMAND" then Return 2
If (FN FT) <> "CMSEPL9 TESTEXEC" | ,
   (Translate(FM) <> "A1" & FM <> "*") then Return 3
If Command <> "TestAsDf" then Return 4
If Prefix <> "TESTEXEC" then Return 5

Parse arg Word1 Word2 Word3
If Word1 <> "ThisIsAVeryBigArgument" then Return 6
If Word2 <> "ThisOneIsToo" then Return 7
If Word3 <> "" then Return 8
If Address() <> Prefix then Return 9

If CMSEPL9B('A') <> 65 then Return 10

Call CMSEPL9B 'B'
If Result <> 56 then Return 11

If CMSEPL9C('','C') <> 150 then Return 12

Call CMSEPL9C '', 'D'
If Result <> 151 then Return 13

If SourceLine() <> 31 then Return 14

/* Tell CMSEPLA we succeeded. */
Return 109
